<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>→ "works" が何回出てくるか探す。</title>
<style>
body {
  font-family: "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 40px;
  color: #222;
}
h1 { font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 0.5em; }
p { margin-bottom: 1.5em; }
button {
  background: #3a6ea5;
  color: #fff;
  border: none;
  padding: 6px 16px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  font-size: 15px;
  cursor: pointer;
  margin-bottom: 1em;
}
.container {
  display: flex;
  gap: 30px;
  align-items: flex-start;
}
.codebox, .outputbox {
  flex: 1;
  font-family: "Consolas", monospace;
  font-size: 15px;
}
.code, .output {
  background: #fff;
  border: 1px solid #ccc;
  border-radius: 6px;
  padding: 14px 16px;
  line-height: 1.8;
  white-space: pre;
}
.output { display: none; }
.output.show { display: block; }
.label { display: block; margin-bottom: 0.4em; font-weight: bold; color: #3a6ea5; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>→ "works" が何回出てくるか探す。</h1>
<p>英文 “My code works. I have no idea why, but it works.” の中に  
単語 "works" が何回出てくるかを数えてみよう。</p>

<button id="runBtn">結果を表示</button>

<div class="container">
  <div class="codebox">
    <div class="label">コード入力</div>
    <div class="code">
import re

text = "My code works. I have no idea why, but it works."
print(len(re.findall("works", text)))
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="outputbox">
    <div class="label">出力結果</div>
    <div class="output" id="outputBox">2</div>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
document.getElementById("runBtn").addEventListener("click", function() {
  document.getElementById("outputBox").classList.add("show");
});
</script>

</body>
</html>
